libopenwch-template — provenance and licensing
=============================================

What this repository is
-----------------------

The application skeleton for libopenwch: a starting point you copy to begin a
firmware project.  It is a separate repository from libopenwch for the same
reason libopencm3-template is separate from libopencm3 -- the library is
something you build against, this is something you build *from*.

It contains no library code.  Everything here is build rules and example
programs; the drivers come from a libopenwch checkout that you point
`OPENWCH_DIR` at.

